      "description": "The woman, dressed in a revealing referee outfit, is positioned centrally holding a beer and a football, visually reinforcing a stereotype of hypersexualized female availability for male gratification. The text 'what men want' explicitly frames her as an object of male desire, reducing her to a sexualized trope.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
